This repository is plain static files. Nothing here is a Jekyll site: no
_config.yml, no front matter, no Liquid, no templates to render. Serve it
as-is.

Added after two Pages builds failed instantly (duration 0, "Page build
failed") on commits whose file lists were almost identical to a commit that
had built fine forty minutes earlier -- so the failure was in Jekyll, not in
anything being published. The live repo (kidsmathsmatrixpuzzle.github.io) has
carried this file all along, which is why it has never shown the same fault.

It also removes 35-55 seconds from every deploy, since Pages stops scanning
and rendering a site that was never a Jekyll site.
